# Root-level npm install sandbox (smoke-tests published rc tarballs against the
# canonical `node/package.json`). The repo root is not an npm package itself;
# `node/` is. These appear when contributors run `npm install aegis-trust` at
# the root for ad-hoc verification — keep them local-only.
/package.json
/package-lock.json

